{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEach(reading:writing:body:)"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forEach","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rTypes","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"writing","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"wTypes","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"), repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Component","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Component","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the fallback for more than 4 read or 4 written types; fewer are served by the overloads with fixed arity,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which are faster because their loop specializes. The contract is the one of those overloads (see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the overload that reads 1 and writes 1 type), with two differences in shape:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" receives the written components first, as one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"type":"text","text":" tuple, then the read components. Swift can not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"express "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout"},{"type":"text","text":" pack parameters in a closure, and two packs in one closure type can not be inferred."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The written components are copied out of the storage into the tuple and back after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" returned, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"write is not visible in the storage before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" returns."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["family.forEach(reading: A.self, B.self, C.self, D.self, E.self, writing: X.self, Y.self) { (written: inout (X, Y), a, b, c, d, e) in","    written.0.value += a.value","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Specialization is disabled for this slow path: the Swift 6.4 SIL GenericSpecializer crashes on it in release builds","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"TypeSubstituter.transformPackElementType","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(N) where N is the number of members, plus one hash lookup per component type.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"forEach"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":", each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reading"},{"kind":"text","text":": repeat (each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":").Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"writing"},{"text":": repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"), repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"}],"externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS6FamilyV7forEach7reading7writing4bodyyqd__mqd__Qp_qd_0_mqd_0_Qpyqd_0_qd_0_Qp_tz_qd__qd__QptKXEtKRvd__Rvd_0_AA9ComponentRd__AaHRd_0_r0_lF","title":"forEach(reading:writing:body:)","conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"each C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text